    "title_en": "Upgrading Polarized Beam Equipment at the JINR Accelerator Facility: Future Prospects",
    "abstract_en": "At the JINR accelerator complex, within the polarization research program of the NICA project, a high-intensity SPI source of polarized deuterons and protons, low-energy polarimeters are being developed for the SPI setup at the outlet and behind the 5 MeV/nucleon linear accelerator The status, upgrades of the above facilities, future prospects are presented.",
